    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "ルドルフ。今日のアンタは生徒会に不要だ。\r\nいつもの椅子には座らず過ごすんだな。",
            "enText": "Rudolf, the student council doesn't need \nyou today. No sitting in your usual chair.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -5349084452497367344,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "……んっ？",
            "enText": "…Hm?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 1487675918148116524,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "前後を省き過ぎだブライアン！\r\nまったく……失礼いたしました、会長。",
            "enText": "You left out all the context, Brian! \nGood grief… Sorry about that, President.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -5234517488821136913,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "まずは、お誕生日おめでとうございます。",
            "enText": "First things first: happy birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2230530643831258735,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……ん。",
            "enText": "……<i>Mm</i>.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -2191298290746139814,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "本日分の生徒会業務は、私とブライアンで\n分担して進めます。どうぞ今日は、\n自由にごゆっくりお過ごしください。",
            "enText": "Any council work that needs doing today, \nBrian and I can take care of. So please, \ntake the day off to relax.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 8953426925922973452,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "……はは！　なるほど、理解した。\r\n三行半でも突きつけられたのかと\n戦々恐々だったよ。",
            "enText": "…Haha! I see, very well then. You had me \nworried for a second there. I thought I was \nbeing ejected from the student council.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -6167706969890440282,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "いや、しかし……そうだな。うむ。\n副会長2人の気遣い、痛み入るが……。",
            "enText": "But then again… Well, hm. \nThough I appreciate the sentiment…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -6109964096529912593,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "……置物とでも思ってくれて構わない。\n生徒会室に顔を出すことくらいは、\n許してもらえないだろうか？",
            "enText": "…I <i>would</i> like to pop into the office now \nand then — feel free to pretend I'm not there. \nYou wouldn't mind that, would you?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -2796080643937150206,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "えっ？　しかし、それでは――",
            "enText": "Huh? But then…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 2872030056915806579,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "ふ……寂しがり屋め。\r\n“皇帝”サマが形なしだな。",
            "enText": "<i>Hmph</i>. Already getting lonely? \nSome \"emperor\" you are.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 8944024994519911607,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ふふ、返す言葉もないよ。",
            "enText": "Heh, you got me there.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -8410036240939208923,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
    "humanTl": true,
    "modified": 1784221660
}